<title>FINLAND: METSALIITTO TO MERGE INVESTMENT FIRMS IN 1997.</title>
<headline>METSALIITTO TO MERGE INVESTMENT FIRMS IN 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forestry cooperative Metsaliitto-Yhtyma plans to merge investment companies Oy Metsamarkka Ab , Lannen Metsa and Oy Sijoitus Forestia Ab during 1997, Metsamarkka said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Terms of the merger will be handled during March 1997,&quot; Metsamarkka said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Metsaliitto announced earlier on Wednesday it had increased its stake in Sijoitus Forestia to 49.8 percent of votes.</p>
<p>Metsamarkka's 1996 financial report will be published on February 12, earlier than previously announced.</p>
<p>    --Helsinki newsroom   +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
